<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 Not found</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: white;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .error-container {
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(100px, 25vw, 300px);
            color: #223345;
            margin: 0;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 42px);
            color: #223345;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        p {
            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 22px);
            color: #223345;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .home-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 20px);
            font-weight: 700;
            border: 1px solid #223345ab;
            background-color: #fff;
            color: #223345ab;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(34, 51, 69, 0.15);
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .home-button:hover {
            color: #223345c7;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(34, 51, 69, 0.2);
        }

        .home-button:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <h1>404</h1>
        <h2>Not found</h2>
        <p>К сожалению, запрашиваемая вами страница не найдена...</p>
        <a href="/" class="home-button">Вернуться на главную страницу</a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>